pySMESH: OCCT 8.0 headers no longer include the TopTools, TColStd and TColgp typedef headers; include the ones each file uses.

In OCCT 7.x, headers such as BRepTools.hxx and BOPAlgo_Builder.hxx brought in the typedef
headers of the TCollection-style containers (TopTools_IndexedMapOfShape.hxx, and so on).
OCCT 8.0 headers use the NCollection types directly and include none of them, so six files
that use those typedefs without including them do not compile. Each file now includes the
typedef headers that it uses. No compiled code changes.

